    {
      "id": "claim_eba6c0bf52ec4f9ba2794989f1e03220",
      "statement": "A DSN is only usable when it starts with http:// or https:// and contains @, and any exception while reading the setting yields the empty string, so a malformed value is reported as dsn_missing (state off) rather than as a failure.",
