    {
      "id": "claim_6feb71f256f4472bb87abd614f63f5b9",
      "statement": "When kind == \"framework\", record_error replaces the identity with framework_identity(bus), which reports artifact sincpro-framework with the installed framework version (\"unknown\" if not installed) while keeping the bus segment, so routing/build failures land under the framework's own release instead of a bounded context's.",
