      "id": "claim_06a68d609c9644f98848ed834ed62455",
      "statement": "Framework-kind reporting call sites are FrameworkBus.execute for UnknownDTOToExecute/DTOAlreadyRegistered, UseFramework.add_dependency for DependencyAlreadyRegistered, and UseFramework.__call__ for SincproFrameworkNotBuilt, all with layer \"framework\" and no span, so only the facade's unroutable-DTO case carries a sincpro.dto tag.",
