    {
      "id": "claim_4ebf25a0b2704ad9b0bd5a845b8fd203",
      "statement": "Expected domain errors must be excluded explicitly with UseFramework.ignore_sentry_exceptions(*exc_types), which forwards to Observability.ignore and accumulates unknown types in a tuple without duplicating; because all three buses share the same Observability object, registering after build_root_bus() takes effect immediately with no propagation step, and error handlers still run for the ignored types.",
