    {
      "id": "claim_b064d55aee5145d082ddc41992bb6e6b",
      "statement": "Error clients are cached in the process-wide registry keyed by the release string (not the bus), so two buses of one deployment share one client object, unlike tracer providers which are keyed per bus; registry.reset() clears the error clients along with the providers and the announced process identity.",
