    {
      "id": "claim_3fc55e198be04ffbaf362afe148cd5a1",
      "statement": "Reporting is wired into the buses, not around them: UseFramework.__call__ runs the middleware pipeline with no except, so a middleware that raises (or anything failing before FrameworkBus.execute) propagates with no record_error call, and every reporting except clause catches only Exception, so KeyboardInterrupt, SystemExit and asyncio.CancelledError skip both reporting and the error handlers.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://sincpro_framework/bus.py#L196-L205",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ee12804e3ebe5fbadecaed4ec37dcd8a2b424e80993e5c25ff8ebd0bec718435:"
