      "id": "claim_d199753ef66c4f0a8a9a53a220217ccd",
      "statement": "process.record_error(error, layer=\"process\") reports transport failures under the process identity (artifact:version with no bus segment) with kind=\"instance\" and no ignore list, so such events carry no sincpro.instance tag and are not affected by ignore_sentry_exceptions.",
