      "id": "claim_fdd5b7378759422fad2eb25d67b16429",
      "statement": "Observability.start() stores the per-backend ComponentStatus from setup_errors/setup_tracing and emits one logger line 'observability sentry=<state>:<reason> otel=<state>:<reason>' at warning level when either backend is failed and info otherwise, swallowing any logger exception; before start() the sentry status reason is the field default not_built.",
